claim.claim-text:
a voice recognition device (20, 21, 22);
a plurality of electronic devices (10, 30, 40, 50) configured to output sound; and
a server (100) configured to receive identification information of the voice recognition device (20, 21, 22) and at least one electronic device (10, 30, 40, 50) located in a region around the voice recognition device (20, 21, 22), and to transmit the identification information to the plurality of electronic devices (10, 30, 40, 50);
wherein, based on receiving information from the server (100) that a voice command is received from a user through the voice recognition device (20, 21, 22), each of the plurality of electronic devices (10, 30, 40, 50) is configured to:
